      "review_description": "So far we have not had our installation carried out.  First excuse was, run out of Growatt inverters, next excuse was, don't recall the conversation, then it was, we received the wrong panels, then the installers would not be able to finish the job on the day and finally, today 2/4/14, weather is holding up the installers and we have to put your job back again.  Significantly concerned having paid $500 deposit, have contacted ASIC to ensure that the company has not gone into liquidation, followed up with a call to Consumer Affairs Victoria then a letter of demand to the company.  Have not had a reply from them, things are not looking good.",
